#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to manage costs of running jobs on QPUs when using the Pay-As-You-Go "
"Plan on IBM Quantum Platform."
msgstr ""
"Paano pamahalaan ang gastos sa pagpapatakbo ng mga job sa QPU kapag "
"gumagamit ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan sa IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang gastos sa Pay-As-You-Go Plan"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage cost on the Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-go-"
"plan}"
msgstr ""
"Pamahalaan ang gastos sa Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#manage-cost-on-the-pay-as-you-"
"go-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to set a cost limit on your Pay-As-You-Go Plan "
"instance.  You can also manage cost by [minimizing a workload's QPU "
"usage](/guides/minimize-time), and setting a [maximum execution "
"time](/guides/max-execution-time) on your workloads.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng gabay na ito kung paano magtakda ng limitasyon sa gastos sa "
"iyong Pay-As-You-Go Plan na instance. Maaari mo ring pamahalaan ang gastos "
"sa pamamagitan ng [pagpapaliit ng QPU usage ng workload](/guides/minimize-"
"time), at pagtakda ng [maximum na oras ng execution](/guides/max-execution-"
"time) sa iyong mga workload.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The _cost limit_ refers to the total cost of all workloads run with this "
"instance since it was created, and it will always be greater than or equal "
"to the total cost. After the instance reaches the specified number of total "
"seconds, no further workloads can be run and no more cost is incurred.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang _limitasyon sa gastos_ ay tumutukoy sa kabuuang gastos ng lahat ng "
"workload na pinatakbo gamit ang instance na ito mula nang ito ay nilikha, at"
" palaging magiging mas malaki o katumbas ng kabuuang gastos. Kapag naabot na"
" ng instance ang tinukoy na kabuuang bilang ng segundo, hindi na maaaring "
"magpatakbo ng karagdagang workload at hindi na madadagdag ang gastos.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The cost limit is always specified in US dollars (USD), then converted to runtime seconds. However, for monthly billing purposes, you are charged in your local currency, specified on your IBM Cloud&reg; account. Because currency exchange rates can fluctuate, the cost for X runtime seconds might be different when initially calculated in USD than when you’re actually charged in your local currency. As a result, if your local currency is not USD, the total amount charged for the number of seconds specified in this field could vary from the dollar amount you specify.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Ang limitasyon sa gastos ay palaging tinutukoy sa US dollars (USD), pagkatapos ay kino-convert sa runtime seconds. Gayunpaman, para sa buwanang billing, sinisingil ka sa iyong lokal na pera, na tinutukoy sa iyong IBM Cloud&reg; account. Dahil maaaring magbago-bago ang mga exchange rate ng pera, ang gastos para sa X runtime seconds ay maaaring magkaiba kapag unang kinakalkula sa USD kaysa kapag talagang sinisingil ka sa iyong lokal na pera. Kaya, kung ang iyong lokal na pera ay hindi USD, ang kabuuang halaga na sinisingil para sa bilang ng segundo na tinukoy sa field na ito ay maaaring mag-iba mula sa halaga sa dolyar na iyong tinukoy.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cost-limit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set or change a cost limit {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr ""
"Magtakda o baguhin ang limitasyon sa gastos {#set-or-change-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to set or change a limit on how much is spent:\n"
msgstr "Maraming paraan para magtakda o baguhin ang limitasyon sa gastos:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Find the instance you want to limit, click the Actions menu at the end of the row, and then click **Edit details**. Set the total cost limit or the usage limit, then click **Save changes**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   You can also set the cost or usage limit when creating a new instance under the Pay-As-You-Go Plan. When you select the Pay-As-You-Go tile, a field appears with the label \"Total cost limit (Optional)\". You can enter a total cost limit in this field.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"* **IBM Quantum Platform**: Buksan ang pahina ng [Mga Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Hanapin ang instance na gusto mong limitahan, i-click ang Actions menu sa dulo ng row, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Edit details**. Itakda ang kabuuang limitasyon sa gastos o ang limitasyon sa paggamit, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Save changes**.\n"
"   <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Maaari ka ring magtakda ng limitasyon sa gastos o paggamit kapag gumagawa ng bagong instance sa ilalim ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan. Kapag pinili mo ang Pay-As-You-Go tile, may lalabas na field na may label na \"Total cost limit (Optional)\". Maaari kang maglagay ng kabuuang limitasyon sa gastos sa field na ito.\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**API**: [Set the instance limit in "
"seconds](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-"
"rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"
msgstr ""
"**API**: [Itakda ang limitasyon ng instance sa "
"segundo](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-"
"rest/tags/instances#tags__instances__operations__replace_instance_data).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Cloud CLI**: For instructions to use the CLI, refer to [Getting "
"started with the IBM Cloud CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Cloud CLI**: Para sa mga tagubilin sa paggamit ng CLI, tingnan ang "
"[Getting started with the IBM Cloud "
"CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cli?topic=cli-getting-started).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View the cost limit {#view-the-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang limitasyon sa gastos {#view-the-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to view the current cost limit:\n"
msgstr "Maraming paraan para tingnan ang kasalukuyang limitasyon sa gastos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Platform**: The Total cost limit is shown on the Pay-As-You-Go"
" tab of the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table.\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Quantum Platform**: Ang Total cost limit ay ipinapakita sa Pay-As-You-"
"Go tab ng talahanayan ng [Mga "
"Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**API**:\n"
msgstr "**API**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   See the [REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr ""
"   Tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng REST "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a cost limit {#remove-a-cost-limit}"
msgstr "Alisin ang limitasyon sa gastos {#remove-a-cost-limit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can remove the cost limit in several ways:\n"
msgstr "Maaari mong alisin ang limitasyon sa gastos sa ilang paraan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Platform**: Open the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) table. Find the "
"instance you want to update, click the overflow menu at the end of the row, "
"and then click **Edit details**. Delete the total cost limit or the usage, "
"then click **Save changes**.\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Quantum Platform**: Buksan ang talahanayan ng [Mga "
"Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Hanapin ang instance na "
"gusto mong i-update, i-click ang overflow menu sa dulo ng row, pagkatapos ay"
" i-click ang **Edit details**. Burahin ang kabuuang limitasyon sa gastos o "
"ang paggamit, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Save changes**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**API**: [Set the instance limit to "
"`null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-"
"rest/tags/instances).\n"
msgstr ""
"**API**: [Itakda ang limitasyon ng instance sa "
"`null`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-"
"rest/tags/instances).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang mga administrator at may-ari lamang ang maaaring mag-edit ng instance. Tingnan ang gabay na [Lumikha ng mga patakaran sa access at mga grupo ng access](/guides/access-groups) para sa impormasyon tungkol sa pag-assign ng access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What happens when the cost limit is reached {#what-happens-when-the-cost-"
"limit-is-reached}"
msgstr ""
"Ano ang mangyayari kapag naabot ang limitasyon sa gastos {#what-happens-"
"when-the-cost-limit-is-reached}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the instance’s cost limit is reached, the currently running job is "
"stopped. Its status is set to Canceled with a reason of Ran too long. Any "
"available partial results are kept.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag naabot na ang limitasyon sa gastos ng instance, ihihinto ang "
"kasalukuyang tumatakbong job. Ang status nito ay itatakda sa Canceled na may"
" dahilang Ran too long. Ang anumang available na partial na resulta ay "
"mananatili.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"No further jobs can be submitted by using this instance until the cost limit"
" is increased.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hindi na maaaring magsumite ng karagdagang job gamit ang instance na ito "
"hanggang sa taasan ang limitasyon sa gastos.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to see what you’re being charged {#how-to-see-what-youre-being-charged}"
msgstr ""
"Paano makita kung magkano ang sinisingil sa iyo {#how-to-see-what-youre-"
"being-charged}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will receive a monthly invoice that provides details about your resource"
" charges. You can check how much has been spent at any time on the [IBM "
"Cloud Billing and usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Makakatanggap ka ng buwanang invoice na nagbibigay ng detalye tungkol sa "
"iyong mga singil sa resource. Maaari mong tingnan kung magkano na ang "
"nagastos anumang oras sa pahina ng [IBM Cloud Billing and "
"usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page displays usage"
" according to the filters you set. Additionally, you can determine cost per "
"instance or per job at any time from the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, as detailed "
"below.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pahina ng [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) ay "
"nagpapakita ng paggamit ayon sa mga filter na iyong itinakda. Bukod dito, "
"maaari mong tukuyin ang gastos bawat instance o bawat job anumang oras mula "
"sa pahina ng [Mga Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), gaya "
"ng detalye sa ibaba.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View instance usage {#view-instance-usage}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang paggamit ng instance {#view-instance-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To determine how much has been billed to an instance, from the "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, click the "
"instance to open its details page. The **Instance usage** field displays the"
" total amount of this instance's QPU usage since it was created.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para malaman kung magkano ang na-bill sa isang instance, mula sa pahina ng "
"[Mga Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), i-click ang "
"instance para buksan ang pahina ng detalye nito. Ang field na **Instance "
"usage** ay nagpapakita ng kabuuang dami ng QPU usage ng instance na ito mula"
" nang ito ay nilikha.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can view your billing cycle on the [Billing and usage "
"page](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong tingnan ang iyong billing cycle sa [pahina ng Billing and "
"usage](https://cloud.ibm.com/billing).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View workload usage {#view-workload-usage}"
msgstr "Tingnan ang paggamit ng workload {#view-workload-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To determine how much has been billed to each workload associated with an "
"instance, from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) "
"page, click the instance to open its details page. Next, click on the value "
"under **Total workloads (all types)**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para malaman kung magkano ang na-bill sa bawat workload na nauugnay sa isang"
" instance, mula sa pahina ng [Mga "
"Instance](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), i-click ang instance "
"para buksan ang pahina ng detalye nito. Pagkatapos, i-click ang value sa "
"ilalim ng **Total workloads (all types)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The **Usage** column displays the amount of QPU consumed by the job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang column na **Usage** ay nagpapakita ng dami ng QPU na ginamit ng job.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up spending notifications {#set-up-spending-notifications}"
msgstr ""
"Mag-set up ng mga notification sa paggastos {#set-up-spending-notifications}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can set up spending notifications to get notified when your account or a"
" particular service reaches a specific spending threshold that you set. For "
"information, see the [IBM Cloud Account "
"types](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts) page. IBM "
"Cloud spending notifications must be used with other methods of cost "
"management for several reasons:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang mag-set up ng mga notification sa paggastos para maabisuhan "
"kapag ang iyong account o isang partikular na serbisyo ay umabot sa isang "
"tiyak na threshold ng paggastos na iyong itinakda. Para sa impormasyon, "
"tingnan ang pahina ng [IBM Cloud Account "
"types](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accounts). "
"Kailangang gamitin ang mga notification sa paggastos ng IBM Cloud kasabay ng"
" iba pang paraan ng pamamahala ng gastos dahil sa ilang kadahilanan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The notifications trigger only *after* cost surpasses the specified limit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga notification ay nati-trigger lamang *pagkatapos* lumampas ang gastos"
" sa tinukoy na limitasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Cost is submitted to the billing system hourly. Therefore, a long delay "
"might occur between the job submission and the spending notification being "
"sent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang gastos ay isinusumite sa sistema ng billing bawat oras. Kaya, maaaring "
"magkaroon ng matagal na pagkaantala sa pagitan ng pagsusumite ng job at ng "
"pagpapadala ng notification sa paggastos.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The billing system can take multiple days to get information to the "
"invoicing system, which might cause further delay in notifications. For more"
" information about how the IBM Cloud billing system works, see [Setting "
"spending notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-"
"usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang sistema ng billing ay maaaring tumagal ng ilang araw bago maipadala ang "
"impormasyon sa sistema ng invoicing, na maaaring magdulot ng karagdagang "
"pagkaantala sa mga notification. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa "
"kung paano gumagana ang sistema ng billing ng IBM Cloud, tingnan ang "
"[Setting spending notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/billing-"
"usage?topic=billing-usage-spending).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [plans](/guides/plans-overview) available to IBM Quantum users.\n"
"- Review suggestions to [minimize job QPU usage](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Learn how to set a [maximum execution time](/guides/max-execution-time) on jobs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Suriin ang mga [plano](/guides/plans-overview) na available sa mga gumagamit ng IBM Quantum.\n"
"- Suriin ang mga mungkahi para [mapaliit ang QPU usage ng job](/guides/minimize-time).\n"
"- Alamin kung paano magtakda ng [maximum na oras ng execution](/guides/max-execution-time) sa mga job.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
